            "content": "## Test data assumption: a hotel with reviews and sentiment data\n\nRevinate has no sandbox. The first hotel the connected Revinate Reputation account can access must have reviews in the last 90 days, guest surveys enabled and sentiment analysis data (at least one topic category with topics).\n\nThis flow has never been run: no Revinate test credentials existed when the connector was built. Whether the snapshot endpoints accept the period and return the fields asserted here is taken from the Porter Swagger file only."
